<title>USA: Scion International says gets U.S. FDA approval.</title>
<headline>Scion International says gets U.S. FDA approval.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scion International Inc said on Monday that the U.S. Food and Drug Administration cleared for marketing its minimally invasive, non-disposable line of endoscopic instruments for the treatment of cardiovascular disease.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1733</p>
</text>
